<title>HONG KONG: Ryoden Dev interim net rises 26.96 pct.</title>
<headline>Ryoden Dev interim net rises 26.96 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   16.6	 vs 13.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    4.0	  vs 4.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  95.14 gain vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    149.66     vs 117.88</p>
<p>    Turnover		     480.67     vs 100.77</p>
<p>    Company name		 Ryoden Development Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 22-25</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   November 4</p>
<p>NOTE - Ryoden Development is a property investor and developer which also provides property management and project management services.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of the group's interest in Ryoden Industrial Centre.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
